+/* BC-250/gfx1013: bail out of TLB flush when MMIO reads come back all-ones.
+ *
+ * Adapted from the project-ariel series (patches 14 and 15), with three
+ * deliberate differences:
+ *
+ *  1. Gated on the BC-250 PCI id. Theirs fires for every gfx10.1.x, which also
+ *     covers Navi10/12/14 -- a Radeon RX 5700 in the same machine would get its
+ *     TLB flush path altered and see log lines about a board it is not.
