+	"BC-250: 1=dump COMPUTE_PGM_LO/HI on page fault, 2=also sweep every SE/SA (debug, races with GRBM)");
+#define BC250_mmCOMPUTE_PGM_LO 0x1bac
+#define BC250_mmCOMPUTE_PGM_HI 0x1bad
